{"id":"abb649d488373612","group":"93","path":"93/93-ex-boolean-subalgebra.md","title":"Boolean Subalgebra","display":"Boolean Subalgebra","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-ex-boolean-subalgebra","aliases":["93-ex-boolean-subalgebra"],"display":"Boolean Subalgebra","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","[[93-df-boolalg]]","[[93-df-subalgebra]]","[[93-fact-boolean-2]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-ex-boolean-subalgebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-ex-boolean-subalgebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Boolean Subalgebra"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7087f500cc845c3b\" href=\"?note=7087f500cc845c3b\" title=\"93-df-boolean-algebra\">93-df-boolean-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"757a95a2c335d9fb\" href=\"?note=757a95a2c335d9fb\" title=\"93-df-boolalg\">93-df-boolalg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" href=\"?note=154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" title=\"93-df-subalgebra\">93-df-subalgebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e2431dc0f64e0f95\" href=\"?note=e2431dc0f64e0f95\" title=\"93-fact-boolean-2\">93-fact-boolean-2</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"ex-boolean-subalgebra---Boolean-Subalgebra\">ex-boolean-subalgebra - Boolean Subalgebra</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>, the carriers <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_2,C_3\">\\(C_2,C_3\\)</span>, the five operation graphs <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BMeet}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{BMeet}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BJoin}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{BJoin}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BNeg}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{BNeg}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BZero}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{BZero}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BOne}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{BOne}_{93}\\)</span>, their family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BOpFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{BOpFam}_{93}\\)</span>, and the algebras <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B_2,\\mathbf B_3\">\\(\\mathbf B_2,\\mathbf B_3\\)</span> are defined below.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(S_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}\\)</span> are sourced from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"757a95a2c335d9fb\" href=\"?note=757a95a2c335d9fb\" title=\"93-df-boolalg\">93-df-boolalg</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7087f500cc845c3b\" href=\"?note=7087f500cc845c3b\" title=\"93-df-boolean-algebra\">93-df-boolean-algebra</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" href=\"?note=154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" title=\"93-df-subalgebra\">93-df-subalgebra</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash\nU\\coloneqq\\{0,1,2\\},\\qquad\nC_2\\coloneqq\\{\\varnothing,U\\},\\qquad C_3\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(U)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash\nU\\coloneqq\\{0,1,2\\},\\qquad\nC_2\\coloneqq\\{\\varnothing,U\\},\\qquad C_3\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(U)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BMeet}_{93}(k;U)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle C,D\\rangle,C\\cap D\\rangle:C,D\\in C_k\\}\n\\qquad(k\\in\\{2,3\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BMeet}_{93}(k;U)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle C,D\\rangle,C\\cap D\\rangle:C,D\\in C_k\\}\n\\qquad(k\\in\\{2,3\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BJoin}_{93}(k;U)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle C,D\\rangle,C\\cup D\\rangle:C,D\\in C_k\\}\n\\qquad(k\\in\\{2,3\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BJoin}_{93}(k;U)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle C,D\\rangle,C\\cup D\\rangle:C,D\\in C_k\\}\n\\qquad(k\\in\\{2,3\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BNeg}_{93}(k;U)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle C,U\\setminus C\\rangle:C\\in C_k\\}\n\\qquad(k\\in\\{2,3\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BNeg}_{93}(k;U)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle C,U\\setminus C\\rangle:C\\in C_k\\}\n\\qquad(k\\in\\{2,3\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BZero}_{93}(k;U)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BOne}_{93}(k;U)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,U\\rangle\\}\n\\qquad(k\\in\\{2,3\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BZero}_{93}(k;U)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BOne}_{93}(k;U)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,U\\rangle\\}\n\\qquad(k\\in\\{2,3\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BOpFam}_{93}(k;U)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle\\wedge,\\operatorname{BMeet}_{93}(k;U)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\vee,\\operatorname{BJoin}_{93}(k;U)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\neg,\\operatorname{BNeg}_{93}(k;U)\\rangle,\n\\langle0,\\operatorname{BZero}_{93}(k;U)\\rangle,\n\\langle1,\\operatorname{BOne}_{93}(k;U)\\rangle\n\\right\\}\\qquad(k\\in\\{2,3\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BOpFam}_{93}(k;U)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle\\wedge,\\operatorname{BMeet}_{93}(k;U)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\vee,\\operatorname{BJoin}_{93}(k;U)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\neg,\\operatorname{BNeg}_{93}(k;U)\\rangle,\n\\langle0,\\operatorname{BZero}_{93}(k;U)\\rangle,\n\\langle1,\\operatorname{BOne}_{93}(k;U)\\rangle\n\\right\\}\\qquad(k\\in\\{2,3\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash\n\\mathbf B_k\\coloneqq\n\\langle C_k,\\operatorname{BOpFam}_{93}(k;U)\\rangle\n\\qquad(k\\in\\{2,3\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash\n\\mathbf B_k\\coloneqq\n\\langle C_k,\\operatorname{BOpFam}_{93}(k;U)\\rangle\n\\qquad(k\\in\\{2,3\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B_2)\\land\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B_3)\\land\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf B_2,\\mathbf B_3).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B_2)\\land\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B_3)\\land\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf B_2,\\mathbf B_3).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The two-element Boolean algebra is the subalgebra of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(U)\">\\(\\mathcal P(U)\\)</span> consisting of its bottom and top elements. Both structures use explicit operation-family graphs of the same Boolean signature. Using <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\})\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\})\\)</span> as the smaller carrier would be ill-typed because its top is not the top of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(U)\">\\(\\mathcal P(U)\\)</span>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"ex-boolean-subalgebra---Boolean-Subalgebra","text":"ex-boolean-subalgebra - Boolean Subalgebra","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"7087f500cc845c3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolalg","status":"resolved","id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","anchor":"ref-2","target